ntrast);font-weight:700\">I</span>\n  <span style=\"min-width:0\">\n    <span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--gray-11)\">IT · This week</span>\n    <span style=\"display:block;margin-top:2px;font-weight:600;color:var(--gray-12)\">Security reminder: phishing emails</span>\n    <span style=\"display:block;margin-top:4px;font-size:14px;color:var(--gray-11)\">IT will never ask for your password. Report a suspicious message with the Report button.</span>\n  </span>\n</article></div>",
